  "design_principle": "Enforce meaningful executions and consequential intelligence capture without rewriting historical events. A Smart Note request is itself a continuity operation: the actual event must become one canonical Note Event with Shawn, Naya, and Machine representations, durable evidence, Intelligent Feed visibility, and a continuation path. PIS promotion is a separate evidenced state transition. Preserve the existing green boundary while making future continuity failures visible and machine-detectable."
